# The build context is the repository root, and most of it has no business
# being sent to the daemon or landing in a layer.

# Version control: excluded deliberately, which is why the build passes
# -buildvcs=false. Sending .git would also send every historical blob.
.git
.github

# Local secrets and state. config.yaml is gitignored and may hold a real
# workspace label; a token store or a database copied into a build context is
# exactly the kind of accident CLAUDE.md 3.2 exists to prevent.
config.yaml
*.db
*.pem
*.crl
tokens/
softhsm2.conf

# Nothing here is needed to compile the service.
docs/
deploy/terraform/
ci/
*.md
